<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <title>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Enter AR/AP accounting location and address for itinerant trade</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>ورود محل حسابداری دریافتنی/پرداختنی و آدرس برای تجارت سیار</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Введите место и адрес расчетов для разъездной торговли</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Seyahat amaçlı ticaret için alacak/borç muhasebesinin yerini ve adresini girin</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Hãy nhập nơi và địa chỉ thanh toán để bán hàng dạng lưu động</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Enter AR/AP accounting location and address for itinerant trade</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Enter AR/AP accounting location and address for itinerant trade</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
    <name>PlaceOfSettlement</name>
    <id>14</id>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
      <segments>PlaceOfSettlement</segments>
    </dataPath>
    <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>PlaceOfSettlementExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>16</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>If the AR/AP accounting location is not specified, the cash register data will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>اگر محل حسابداری دریافتنی/پرداختنی مشخص نشود، هنگام چاپ رسید از داده‌های صندوق فروش استفاده خواهد شد</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Если место расчетов не будет указано, при печати чека будут использоваться данные по кассе ККМ</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Alacak/Borç muhasebesi yeri belirtilmemişse, fiş yazdırılırken yazar kasa verileri kullanılacaktır</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Nếu chưa chỉ ra nơi thanh toán thì khi in phiếu sẽ sử dụng dữ liệu theo quầy thu ngân</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>If the AR/AP accounting location is not specified, the cash register data will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>If the AR/AP accounting location is not specified, the cash register data will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>PlaceOfSettlementContextMenu</name>
      <id>15</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>InputField</type>
    <editMode>Enter</editMode>
    <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
    <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
    <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:InputFieldExtInfo">
      <width>40</width>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <wrap>true</wrap>
      <chooseType>true</chooseType>
      <typeDomainEnabled>true</typeDomainEnabled>
      <textEdit>true</textEdit>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
    <name>SettlementAddress</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
      <segments>SettlementAddress</segments>
    </dataPath>
    <toolTipRepresentation>ShowAuto</toolTipRepresentation>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>SettlementAddressExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>3</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>If the address is not specified, the business address of the company will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>اگر آدرس مشخص نشود، هنگام چاپ رسید از آدرس تجاری شرکت استفاده خواهد شد</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Если адрес не будет указан, при печати чека будет использоваться фактический адрес организации</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Adres belirtilmemişse, fiş yazdırılırken iş yerinin gerçek adresi kullanılacaktır</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Nếu chưa chỉ ra địa chỉ, khi in phiếu sẽ sử dụng địa chỉ thực tế của doanh nghiệp</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>If the address is not specified, the business address of the company will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>If the address is not specified, the business address of the company will be used when printing the receipt</value>
      </title>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>SettlementAddressContextMenu</name>
      <id>2</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>InputField</type>
    <editMode>Enter</editMode>
    <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
    <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
    <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:InputFieldExtInfo">
      <width>40</width>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <wrap>true</wrap>
      <chooseType>true</chooseType>
      <typeDomainEnabled>true</typeDomainEnabled>
      <textEdit>true</textEdit>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
